thub.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116187.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-19T16:24:55Z"},"body":"Supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/83267\r\n\r\nThis adds `reload_open_files()` to the script editor.\r\n\r\nPursuant to @kitbdev 's feedback:\r\n> This can cause unsaved changes to be lost without confirmation.\r\n> It would be better to expose _test_script_times_on_disk (and maybe _update_modified_scripts_for_external_editor which is usually called after it?, effectively _on_find_in_files_modified_files) if needed.\r\n\r\nI have implemented `reload_open_files()` to call `_test_script_times_on_disk()` and `_update_modified_scripts_for_external_editor()`. This will reload all the scripts if there are no unsaved scripts; if there are, the user will be prompted to save them first.\r\n\r\n- *bugsquad edit* Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8111","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116187/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"